    "capsuleRestClearance": "every capsule radius = min(stock radius, distance to the nearest rest cape vertex - 1 cm) on the Idle_Loop t = 0 pose, dropped under 0.1 cm (game.ts: measureBodyCapsules(capeSkin, 16, restWorld, COLLIDER_THICKNESS)); applied in RunDrive, in memory, restored after the run"
  },
  "determinism": "3 separate simulations (a fresh world and fresh clothing actors per run, CharDynProbe RunDrive); Chaos Cloth at a fixed step is deterministic, so the run files are byte-identical and the spread is 0",
  "differences": {
    "crossfade": "the game's AnimationPlayer smoothstep crossfade is replayed by UCharDynAnimInstance; Unreal blends the poses with FAnimationRuntime::BlendPosesTogether (normalised quaternion blend) where three.js accumulates slerps, and samples the Interchange-resampled clips",
    "readback": "Unreal reads the simulated positions every tick for the same tick's pose; the game reads a GPU readback every 2 frames and matches it to the pose of the step that produced it",
    "gravity": "-9.80 m/s^2 in Unreal, -9.81 m/s^2 in the game"
  },
  "hair": {
    "node": "FAnimNode_SpringBone, one per simulated bone (ponytail_2..6), parent first, each fed the previous node's pose, driven in UCharDynAnimInstance's proxy; ponytail_1 rides Head (SpringBoneChain3D's root)",
    "defaults": "stock (UE 5.8.3: Engine/Source/Runtime/AnimGraphRuntime/Private/BoneControllers/AnimNode_SpringBone.cpp:16-38): SpringStiffness 50, SpringDamping 4, ErrorResetThresh 256 cm, bLimitDisplacement false, translate X/Y/Z on, rotate X/Y/Z off; fixed step 1/120 s (:62-63); no gravity, no collision",
    "differences": "SpringBoneChain3D (game) keeps each segment at its rest length, rotates the bones toward the particles and pushes them out of the body capsules; the stock SpringBone translates the bone only, so segments stretch, and it has no collider. Its damping acts on the world velocity and OwnerVelocity is 0 for an actor's own component (AnimNode_SpringBone.cpp:139-157, 257-266), so each spring trails its target by damping * speed / stiffness (27 cm at 3.4 m/s) and the 5 springs add up. Teleport: SpringBone resets past 256 cm of error, SpringBoneChain3D past 1.5 m of root move or 1 m of error",
    "start": "the springs are placed on the Idle_Loop t = 0 pose by a zero-length evaluation before tick 1 (InitAnim's zero tick, SkeletalMeshComponent.cpp:1213-1216; the game builds SpringBoneChain3D on that pose)"
  },
  "hairAnimDynamics": {
    "prd": "PRD-912 AC-3",
    "node": "FAnimNode_AnimDynamics, bChain true, BoundBone ponytail_1, ChainEnd ponytail_6: one rigid body per bone, each joined to its parent at the segment midpoint (InitPhysics, AnimNode_AnimDynamics.cpp:1110-1121); ponytail_1's body is nailed to its animated position (bLinearFullyLocked, :1272-1277), so it rides Head and ponytail_2..6 hang from it. Evaluated in UCharDynAnimInstance's proxy on the animated pose, beside the SpringBone chain; the output is recorded, not applied",
    "defaults": "stock (UE 5.8.3: Engine/Source/Runtime/AnimGraphRuntime/Private/BoneControllers/AnimNode_AnimDynamics.cpp:190-246 and Public/BoneControllers/AnimNode_AnimDynamics.h:91-110, 241-248): one body definition copied to every chain bone (UpdateChainPhysicsBodyDefinitions, :831-866), BoxExtents 10 x 10 x 10 cm, LocalJointOffset 0, CollisionType CoM, linear X/Y/Z Limited 0..0 (locked), angular type Angular with limits 0..0 on X/Y/Z and twist axis X; GravityScale 1 (:195) with the project gravity -980 cm/s2 (PhysicsSettingsCore.cpp:29, AnimPhysicsSolver.cpp:875); linear and angular damping 0.7 (AnimPhysicsSolver.h:56-59), JointBiasFactor 0.3 (:53), mass 1 (AnimPhysicsSolver.cpp:159); NumSolverIterationsPreUpdate 4, PostUpdate 1 (:202-203); SimulationSpace Component (:205); ComponentLinearAccScale and ComponentLinearVelScale 0 (:238-239), SimSpaceAngularAlpha 0 (:183); no linear or angular spring (:219-220), no wind (:215), no planar or spherical limits (none listed; :208-209), so no collision; adaptive substepping off (p.AnimDynamicsAdaptiveSubstep 0, :26), so one step of the tick delta per tick, capped at MaxPhysicsDeltaTime 1/30 s (:691-701, PhysicsSettings.cpp:22)",
    "arms": {
      "stock": "every value stock",
      "swing": "named override: AngularLimitsMin/Max -180/+180 on X/Y/Z, the editor's range end (AnimNode_AnimDynamics.h:170-174). ConstrainAngularRange adds no swing limit for a range of 360 degrees (AnimPhysicsSolver.cpp:733-757); twist stays locked (:759-760). The stock 0..0 range locks each body to its parent (:733-736), a rigid chain",
      "swingWorld": "swing plus the named override SimulationSpace World. Stock Component space passes no component motion to the bodies (ComponentLinearAccScale/VelScale 0, SimSpaceAngularAlpha 0, :600-646), so locomotion and turns do not reach the chain; World space keeps the bodies in the world, as SpringBoneChain3D does. On the first teleport tick the arms get ResetDynamics(TeleportPhysics), what a SetActorLocation with ETeleportType::TeleportPhysics does to an AnimGraph (SkeletalMeshComponent.cpp:5350-5354, AnimInstance.cpp:696-700); the cloth keeps its own teleport guard"
    },
    "boxExtents": "stock 10 cm cube kept: with mass 1 per body it sets only the inertia, and it is the same order as the 7.8 cm segment; collision is off, so it touches nothing",
    "start": "Initialize_AnyThread on the Idle_Loop t = 0 pose before tick 1 (ResetSprings), so InitPhysics places every body on its bone with no time debt (AnimNode_AnimDynamics.cpp:248-268, 1002-1196)",
    "restLengths": "the SpringBone block's: segment lengths on the Idle_Loop t = 0 pose",
